{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109260","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1110926001:0":{"text":"... 이거 놔.","source_cn":"……放手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F7393E9FADB1F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110926002:1":{"text":"그렇게 말하면 섭섭하지. 우리 둘이 동시에 목걸이를 잡았어. 누가 먼저인지 구분할 수 없을 정도로 말이야.","source_cn":"话不能这么说，小兄弟。项链是咱俩同时抢到的，分不出先来后到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44F5570AEDBE158E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110926003:1":{"text":"내가 너보다 느릴 리가 없잖아.","source_cn":"我不可能比你慢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x262DCC5A3F8A7E79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110926004:1":{"text":"흥, 성격 하고는.","source_cn":"嗬，真有脾气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB10881ACA8639781","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110926005:1":{"text":"내가 에디 녀석을 잡지 않았다면 그 녀석은 벌써 도망갔을 거다. 햄스터가 스무 마리나 있었어도 절대 못 잡았을걸.","source_cn":"要不是我拦住阿德那小子，他早就跑了。就算你们再有二十只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5475698F98FD9831","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110926006:1":{"text":"숫자는 늘어나 봤자 방해만 될 뿐이야.","source_cn":"那么多人只会拖累我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x073D7DFC67B8855F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110926007:1":{"text":"... 하, 하하하. 형씨, 정말 재미있는 사람이네!","source_cn":"……哈，哈哈哈。小兄弟，你可真有意思！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB74DACF3050B8D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110926008:1":{"text":"하지만 나도 이번 일은 포기할 수 없어.","source_cn":"但只有这件事，我不能放手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB79D530F9F883CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1110926008":{"text":"하지만 나도 이번 일은 포기할 수 없어.","source_cn":"但只有这件事，我不能放手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB79D530F9F883CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110926011:0":{"text":"... 그래, 사트라나에게 맡기자.","source_cn":"……行吧。交给萨忒娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE428742C2B54A082","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110926012:0":{"text":"“운명”이 그녀를 올바른 결정으로 인도할 거라 믿어.","source_cn":"我相信“命运”会让她做出正确决定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA313139CACEBA849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110926013:0":{"text":"이봐, 나는 아직 동의 안 했다고.","source_cn":"喂，我还没说同意呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AC3EC0B398E6F39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110926014:0":{"text":"정말 싸우고 싶은 거야?","source_cn":"你真想打一架？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633931721C90C938","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110926015:0":{"text":"하하하, 네가 아무리 날쌔도 총은 못 이길걸.","source_cn":"哈哈哈，不管你身手多矫健，也比不过枪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8187AED1C6B517B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110926016:0":{"text":"됐어. 그 여우 소녀는 보통 사람과 사고방식 자체가 다르더군. 사람보다 운명을 더 믿는 것 같았어.","source_cn":"算了，那狐狸女孩的思维不同常人，比起个人，她更相信运势。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE13F590DD873F242","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110926017:0":{"text":"수많은 현상금 임무와 모험 속에서 살아남은 나와 비교하면 너희는 승산이 없어.","source_cn":"比起能在无数悬赏和冒险中活下来的我，你们未必有胜算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8637FEAC115A631","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_in